[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4010778869","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117137#issuecomment-4010778869","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117137","id":4010778869,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vD6D1","user":{"login":"Adrien-Lucas","id":16429096,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDI5MDk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16429096?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas","html_url":"https://github.com/Adrien-Lucas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-06T10:03:19Z","updated_at":"2026-03-06T10:03:19Z","body":"Congrats on opening a PR for my proposal!\r\n\r\nJust a remark about that:\r\n> Currently, the default value for the collision_preset property on CollisionObjects is 0, which represents the default collision preset. For backwards compatibility reasons it may be better to have this be -1 (which represents <custom>) for now, so that setting the default collision preset in ProjectSettings will not nuke all existing layer and mask settings. (no changes will occur until the default collision preset setting is set though)\r\n\r\nIf it always defaults to -1 (custom) then the feature loses it's interest. The best would be for the value to be -1 for existing nodes when migrating, and then 0 for all new nodes that will be created later on.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4010778869/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4014921472","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117137#issuecomment-4014921472","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117137","id":4014921472,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vTtcA","user":{"login":"Ardot66","id":142978236,"node_id":"U_kgDOCIWsvA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142978236?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66","html_url":"https://github.com/Ardot66","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-07T00:15:47Z","updated_at":"2026-03-07T00:15:47Z","body":"I just pushed a fix for the compatibility breakage. The unit tests should pass now that it's fixed from my testing.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4014921472/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4023154725","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117137#issuecomment-4023154725","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117137","id":4023154725,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vzHgl","user":{"login":"Adrien-Lucas","id":16429096,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDI5MDk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16429096?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas","html_url":"https://github.com/Adrien-Lucas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T11:42:03Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T11:42:03Z","body":"Hi @Ardot66 I've finally had some time to try your PR on my own :) \r\n\r\nFirst of all: great work! \r\nIt feels great to be able to edit the bitmasks directly in the Project settings, it's very clean. \r\nI also love the preset order can be customized.\r\n\r\nIn the current version, collision presets are only about setting layer and mask on a node. You have skipped all features that makes it possible to use presets as an abstraction layer to layers&masks, allowing for raycasting a specific collision preset for example. What are the reasons for skipping these features?\r\n\r\nHere are a few remarks I think should be adressed:\r\n* It shouldn't be possible to see/select `<custom>` in the `physics/3d/default_preset`\r\n* Would it be possible to display `Default` instead of `<default>` and `Custom` instead of `<custom>`?\r\n* At runtime, when inspecting the Remote version of a node, the displayed collision preset is always `<custom>` if the selected preset was `<default>` instead of the preset set as default in the project settings.\r\n* In my IDE, I don't see get_collision_preset() and set_collision_preset(int) as suggestions  with auto completing. I don't know how Godot manages this.\r\n* In the plugin, I am auto generating constant for each preset. They look like `CollisionPreset.YOUR_PRESET_NAME`, this makes presets super useful to manipulate in scripts. Would it be possible to integrate a similar feature?\r\n```\r\n    if my_static_body.get_collision_preset() == CollisionPreset.WorldGeometry:\r\n\t    # do something\r\n```\r\n* It would be a great addition to add a preset array `presets` to `PhysicsRayQueryParameters2D` and `PhysicsRayQueryParameters3D` that, in addition to `collision_mask` will add a preset filter to a query.\r\n```\r\n\tvar query := PhysicsRayQueryParameters3D.create(from, to)\r\n\tquery.presets = [CollisionPreset.WorldGeometry, CollisionPreset.DynamicProps]\r\n\tvar result := space_state.intersect_ray(query)\r\n```","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4023154725/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4029059220","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117137#issuecomment-4029059220","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117137","id":4029059220,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wJpCU","user":{"login":"Ardot66","id":142978236,"node_id":"U_kgDOCIWsvA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142978236?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66","html_url":"https://github.com/Ardot66","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-10T06:38:20Z","updated_at":"2026-03-10T06:42:29Z","body":"Thanks for the feedback @Adrien-Lucas! I suppose I may have taken your proposal a little too literally (`<default>` and `<custom>` being a result of that), and I did forgo the kind of script integration in your plugin, mostly because I didn't think it was necessary at the time. \r\n\r\nI'll definitely fix up your first two issues, but I just tried your third point and I cannot get `<custom>` to show instead of `<default>` in remote. For your last three points, I think that implementing a couple singletons along the lines of `ResourceUID`; maybe called `CollisionPresets2D` and `CollisionPresets3D` with functions exposed to work with presets is probably the best way to handle your last three points. These singletons would have functions to get presets by name (covering your global var use case), and get a preset's mask and layer from its ID. Anything more is probably overkill, and this PR is already quite large.\r\n\r\nI think that modifying `PhysicsQueryParameters` is a bit outside the scope of this PR, and not really necessary once I get the singletons added, as it's a relatively niche use case with a quick workaround.\r\n\r\nHow does this all sound?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4029059220/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4029652339","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117137#issuecomment-4029652339","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117137","id":4029652339,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wL51z","user":{"login":"Adrien-Lucas","id":16429096,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDI5MDk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16429096?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas","html_url":"https://github.com/Adrien-Lucas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adrien-Lucas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-10T08:44:24Z","updated_at":"2026-03-10T08:44:24Z","body":"@Ardot66 Yes these changes would be a great start for a first PR on this feature :) As you say it's better to not overscope. \r\n\r\nMy proposal was not exhaustive enough, and I added QoL features to my plugin in the meantime while using it in production, so the concept has a bit evolved in my head since.\r\n\r\nThe `PhysicsQueryParameters` preset filter I believe would be a great QoL to really take the best out of this feature, but it can come later for sure.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4029652339/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4029845167","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117137#issuecomment-4029845167","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117137","id":4029845167,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wMo6v","user":{"login":"Ardot66","id":142978236,"node_id":"U_kgDOCIWsvA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142978236?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66","html_url":"https://github.com/Ardot66","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ardot66/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-10T09:19:07Z","updated_at":"2026-03-10T09:19:07Z","body":"Alright, I just pushed all of the changes I mentioned in my previous comment!","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/